package meta

// SystemEntityID returns the element $ID of the System entity named name
// ("Language", not "System.Language"), as canonical GUID text: what Studio Pro
// writes where a document refers to a System entity by id, such as an agent's
// context entity (ako/mxcli#2292).
//
// The System module is not in the project, so this id cannot be read from it.
// It is MEASURED (system_entity_ids.go, generated by TestSystemEntityIDsUpdate)
// from the System domain model in built model.mdp files. Most System entities
// have a fixed $ID that mxbuild ships and that is the same in 10.24 and 11.16;
// a few are added at load with an $ID minted per session, so two builds of the
// same project disagree on them. Those have no id to write and are not in the
// table: ok is false for them, as it is for a name that is not a System entity.
func SystemEntityID(name string) (id string, ok bool) {
	id, ok = systemEntityIDs[name]
	return id, ok
}
